OL,3,GNEWSAPawn shop ram raided and targeted 
OL,4,Atwice in 12 hours                      
OL,6,FA pawn shop has been burgled twice in  
OL,7,Fless than 12 hours, first by men on    
OL,8,Fmopeds using a sledgehammer, then when 
OL,9,Fa van was driven into the front of the 
OL,10,Fbuilding.                              
OL,12,FThe first burglary at Cash Creators on 
OL,13,FShirley High Street involved four men  
OL,14,Farriving at the store on mopeds at     
OL,15,Fabout 17:10 GMT on Wednesday.          
OL,17,FTwo of the men entered the store       
OL,18,Fcarrying a sledgehammer, threatened    
OL,19,Fstaff, and stole a "large quantity" of 
OL,20,Fgold and phones.                       
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
